{"id":71390,"date":"2026-10-29T22:24:42","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T22:24:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71390"},"modified":"2026-10-29T23:26:33","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T22:26:33","slug":"sao-silvestre-constancia","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-constancia\/","title":{"rendered":"11\u00aa Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre Solid\u00e1ria Const\u00e2ncia \u2013 Brigmec 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">11\u00aa Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre Solid\u00e1ria Const\u00e2ncia \u2013 Brigmec 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>11\u00aa Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre Solid\u00e1ria Const\u00e2ncia \u2013 Brigmec 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>12 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado), nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es do <strong>Campo Militar de Santa Margarida (CMSM)<\/strong>, em Santa Margarida da Coutada, no concelho de <strong>Const\u00e2ncia<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. O evento conjuga desporto e solidariedade ao longo de todo o dia, com as provas dos escal\u00f5es jovens a arrancar \u00e0s <strong>11:00<\/strong>, as caminhadas a partir das <strong>14:25<\/strong> e a corrida principal de <strong>10 km<\/strong> com tiro de partida \u00e0s <strong>15:00<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo integra a prova principal de <strong>10 km<\/strong> (para Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos), cujo tra\u00e7ado percorre o interior da unidade militar e as localidades vizinhas de <strong>Vale Mestre<\/strong>, <strong>Aldeia de Santa Margarida da Coutada<\/strong> e <strong>Malpique<\/strong>, al\u00e9m de cinco corridas para escal\u00f5es jovens (dos <strong>300 m<\/strong> aos <strong>4,1 km<\/strong>), uma <strong>Caminhada de 7 km<\/strong> e uma <strong>Mini Caminhada de 3 km<\/strong>. Podes planear o teu ritmo de prova na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e consultar o calend\u00e1rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-dezembro\/\">Corridas em Dezembro<\/a> e <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-santarem\/\">Corridas em Santar\u00e9m<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada conjuntamente pela <strong>Brigada Mecanizada (BrigMec)<\/strong> do Ex\u00e9rcito Portugu\u00eas e pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Const\u00e2ncia<\/strong>, esta <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\">corrida de 10 km<\/a> tem inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita mediante a entrega de donativos em g\u00e9neros ou brinquedos no secretariado, revertendo a favor da Loja Social da <strong>Santa Casa da Miseric\u00f3rdia de Const\u00e2ncia<\/strong>, da associa\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>Os Quatro Cantos do Cisne<\/strong> e do <strong>Projeto Pipoca Beatriz<\/strong>. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Cam